            ; 2026-07-21, Stone 4 — the first real llama3.2:3b token generated
            ; form-native. The registry's first open row said the quantized
            ; matvec was slow BECAUSE its per-row fold is serial, and that
            ; parallelising it needed a named epsilon. Profiling a real token
            ; per tensor SHAPE said otherwise: 1024x3072 took 2.618 ms, 3072x3072
