            ; into ONE row (gated pooling over compressor_gate/ape/norm — tensors
            ; we never load), places it at comp_pos = pos+1-ratio, rotates THAT
            ; with base 160000, fp8-rounds it, and stores it beside a raw f32
            ; cache whose keys carry PLAIN rope at true positions. ds4 --inspect
            ; says it out loud: "KV (raw 0.36 + compressed 0.25)". Two lanes.
            ; WHAT WE DID DIFFERENT: we ported the compressed side-cache as if it
            ; were the attention itself — on 41 of 43 layers our keys were rotated
            ; base-160000 at raw positions and fp8-rounded, where ds4's
            ; short-context answer comes from the raw base-10000 lane we never
