            ; 977 — darkbranch. Urs: "clean up all the switches and knobs and knowledge
            ; base and memory to set the record straight and help ground that the only
            ; limit are the physical hardware and our imagination." Doing it found the
            ; shape of the mistake, written in my own hand. Two of the first four
            ; switches removed carried comments that said, in as many words, "REFUTED,
            ; and kept as the falsifier":
            ;   HZ_SCOPED  memoryBarrier(resources:) — 1844 barriers/token vs 1510,
            ;              39.14 ms vs 38.17. The finer claim is true; the hardware
            ;              does not reward it.
            ;   PAD        N empty dispatches per layer to price an ask — slope 1.1 us,
            ;              which settled that dispatch COUNT is not what a token costs.
            ; Both findings are real and both belong in the record. Neither needed to
            ; stay EXECUTABLE. I had told myself a losing branch is a falsifier — that
            ; keeping it means the refutation can be re-run. But the refutation lives in
            ; the NUMBERS, and the branch is a second program maintained in the dark:
            ; never exercised, never verified, silently rotting against every change to
            ; the path that won, and counted forever in the census of questions this
            ; body asks its caller. A falsifier you cannot afford to run is not a
            ; falsifier, it is a costume worn by dead code.
            ; The other two, MOE_FUSE2 and Q80_CPU_ORDER, were worse and quieter:
            ; comments promising an A/B whose implementation had already been deleted.
            ; The tree offered a switch that did not exist.
            ; Deleting all four left the lane bit-identical — 113 PASS, 101 gates, same
            ; decoded stream — which is the proof of the disposition rule: THE DEFAULT
            ; ALREADY IS THE DECISION. Whatever a switch does when unset is what we
            ; ship, every day, to everyone; the other branch is a decision made and
            ; never written down. Census 78 -> 71, ratchet set at 71 so it can only
            ; fall. 48 experiments remain.
