            ; 978 — hostknows. Urs: "what are we trying to defend? we don't need any
            ; switches or knobs... allow for all downloaded local models to be usable
            ; in form cli with a runtime switch, not static switches and knobs."
            ; The answer to the first question is that I was defending my own prior
