            ; validated. The flatten succeeded. `functions=` moved by the correct
            ; amount. The binary grew. Four instruments green, and the VOICE CANARY was
            ; the only one that saw it — ping must answer pong, and it did not.
            ; The teaching is about what a forgiving runtime buys and what it costs. A
            ; lifter that rescues a misnested defn removes the symptom and keeps the
            ; defect, and the defect compounds silently until something is added inside
            ; the masked region. The mask is not the bug; the mask is why the bug got to
            ; be old.
