            ; nothing is not a value you can compare or add. An absence given a
            ; value re-enters the domain it was meant to stand outside of, and
            ; then two absences are one presence.
            ; The two full kernels refuse to produce it at all — fatal
            ; bounds_violation, whose trace carries its own avoidance line
            ; telling the reader to "use a boundary-aware recipe that returns an
