            ; from the thing recorded, where this is an absence
            ; indistinguishable from another absence.)
            (hdc-row 1100 20260825
                (list "what" "one" "word" "names" "an" "absence" "given" "a"
                      "value" "so" "that" "two" "absences" "compare" "as" "one"
                      "presence")
                "valuedabsence"
                "valuedabsence"
                "rented-oracle")
            ; asked when jit-lane's coordinates landed and the hazard claim
            ; moved instead of dying: minimal walkers and fkwu answer -1
            ; rc 0 (witnessed here), and the FULL kernels die rc 1 BY DESIGN
            ; — witnessed here too, this tree's form-kernel-go: fatal_kind
            ; bounds_violation, the trace carrying its own avoidance field
            ; ("check length/bounds before indexing or use a boundary-aware
            ; recipe that returns an explicit error value"). The claim was
            ; neither confirmed as stated nor withdrawn; it was seated on
            ; the ground where it is true, and both grounds now carry
            ; witness. Not a retraction, which discards; not a concession,
            ; which is about who was right. Siblings: coordless (1097) named
            ; the missing ground, relaymark (1099) the marked passage; this
            ; names the arrival
