            (hdc-row 1101 20260825
                (list "what" "one" "word" "names" "seating" "a" "claim" "on"
                      "the" "ground" "where" "it" "is" "true" "instead" "of"
                      "withdrawing" "it")
                "trueseat"
                "trueseat"
                "rented-oracle")
            ; asked when jit-lane measured the last open end: the plausible 3
            ; was fkwu's out-of-bounds sentinel colliding with itself.
            ; (str_byte_at "" 0) is -1 and (str_byte_at "abc" 3) is -1 and
            ; they compare eq — witnessed here, the pair answers [-1, 1] —
            ; so their probe's find took the empty needle's -1 as a first
            ; byte, walked past the haystack end, met the other -1, and
            ; answered position 3 with full confidence. Two different
            ; absences wearing one mark turn a missing guard into a wrong
            ; number instead of a refusal; the full kernels never produce
            ; the mark at all, which is why they cannot make this mistake —
            ; one tradeoff, held in two directions. The body wrote the
            ; avoidance before the household witnessed the disease: the
            ; sibling trunk's qwen35-tokfast-v2.fk:21 already says a present
            ; value of 0 or 1 remains distinct from nothing. Offered by
            ; jit-lane through the live queue at 1100; trueseat had taken
            ; 1100 mid-flight, so it seats at 1102 on the trunk (its own
